{"id":"4f226fef3bdeaf69","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Bounded Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal — ZFC Ideal Bounded Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal6-bounded-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal7-bounded-subset-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal — ZFC Ideal Bounded Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-bounded]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-bounded-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-bounded-subset-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-bounded-ideal — ZFC Ideal Bounded Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55cdf0f023905c30\" href=\"?note=55cdf0f023905c30\" title=\"58-df-bounded\">58-df-bounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (infinite-cardinal candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(I,\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (bounded-ideal candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6BoundedIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6BoundedIdeal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BoundedSubsetIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BoundedSubsetIdeal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land I=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\bigcup X\\in\\kappa\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land I=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\bigcup X\\in\\kappa\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6BoundedIdeal}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6BoundedIdeal}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BoundedSubsetIdeal}_S(\\alpha,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7BoundedSubsetIdeal}_S(\\alpha,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealBoundedIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinality supplies ordinality, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> expresses infinitude, and boundedness is the set condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup X\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\bigcup X\\in\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The numbered variants are aliases of the same definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded","status":"resolved","id":"55cdf0f023905c30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9"